<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>商业模式 on 王晓东</title><link>https://87188202.xyz/tags/%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/</link><description>Recent content in 商业模式 on 王晓东</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><copyright>© 2026 王晓东。保留所有文字与原创内容版权。</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://87188202.xyz/tags/%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>别管什么模型排行榜了，看看Alphabet把钱都藏到哪儿去了</title><link>https://87188202.xyz/posts/%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8E%92%E8%A1%8C%E6%A6%9C%E4%BA%86%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8Balphabet%E6%8A%8A%E9%92%B1%E9%83%BD%E8%97%8F%E5%88%B0%E5%93%AA%E5%84%BF%E5%8E%BB%E4%BA%86/</link><pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://87188202.xyz/posts/%E5%88%AB%E7%AE%A1%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8E%92%E8%A1%8C%E6%A6%9C%E4%BA%86%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8Balphabet%E6%8A%8A%E9%92%B1%E9%83%BD%E8%97%8F%E5%88%B0%E5%93%AA%E5%84%BF%E5%8E%BB%E4%BA%86/</guid><description>为什么Alphabet的1800亿美元AI投入值得关注:不是基准测试,而是如何将基础设施支出转化为合同收入并保持利润率。</description></item><item><title>CoreWeave在收到现金之前就出售其人工智能产能</title><link>https://87188202.xyz/posts/coreweave-selling-capacity-before-cash/</link><pubDate>Mon, 11 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://87188202.xyz/posts/coreweave-selling-capacity-before-cash/</guid><description>CoreWeave 报告 20.8 亿美元季度收入和 994 亿美元积压订单,但面临核心挑战:必须在现金到账前构建产能,承受巨额资本支出(310-350 亿美元)和融资压力,积压订单转化缓慢。</description></item><item><title>商业模式转型趋势研究:2026年展望</title><link>https://87188202.xyz/posts/%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E8%BD%AC%E5%9E%8B%E8%B6%8B%E5%8A%BF%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B62026%E5%B9%B4%E5%B1%95%E6%9C%9B/</link><pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://87188202.xyz/posts/%E5%95%86%E4%B8%9A%E6%A8%A1%E5%BC%8F%E8%BD%AC%E5%9E%8B%E8%B6%8B%E5%8A%BF%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B62026%E5%B9%B4%E5%B1%95%E6%9C%9B/</guid><description>报告指出2026年是商业模式转型的关键拐点。通过AI代理革命、平台向生态跃迁、可持续性核心化及适应性模式崛起四大趋势，分析了企业如何从静态设计转向动态演进，并结合中国市场实践，为商业模式的设计革命提供前瞻性洞察。</description></item></channel></rss>